# Snake assets

Generated by `tools/make_assets.py` (Pillow, numpy, ffmpeg); layout follows game-developer `docs/assets.md` (artist#2).

- `images/` (32x32 cell, RGBA): `snake_head.png` (faces right), `snake_body.png` (horizontal, full-width so it tiles with head/tail), `snake_tail.png` (points left), `food.png` (apple, ~24px), `tile.png` (opaque, low contrast), `title.png` (512x160 logo).
- `audio/`: `eat.mp3`, `game_over.mp3`, `start.mp3`: 44.1 kHz mono, peak ~-3 dBFS. Browsers block audio until a key press/click.
- `theme.json`: background `#101820`, text `#f0f0e0`, accent `#7bd36b`, danger `#e0533b`, font "Press Start 2P" with `fontFile` in `fonts/`.
- `fonts/PressStart2P-Regular.ttf`: Press Start 2P, SIL Open Font License 1.1 (CodeMan38).
